OL,3,GNEWSAAlderney flights cancelled due to
OL,4,Acrew sickness
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn airline has warned it is unable to
OL,7,Foperate several of its upcoming flights
OL,8,Fdue to "an unprecedented level of crew
OL,9,Fsickness".
OL,11,FGuernsey States-owned airline Aurigny
OL,12,Fsaid on Thursday that it had been
OL,13,Fadvised of the issue by Skybus, the
OL,14,Fairline it contracts to operate
OL,15,Fservices to and from Alderney.
OL,17,FSkybus CEO Stuart Reid apologised
OL,18,F"unreservedly" for the impact on
OL,19,Fservices between Guernsey and Alderney
OL,20,Fand Alderney and Southampton until 16
OL,21,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
