OL,3,GNEWSAAlderney flights cancelled due to
OL,4,Acrew sickness
OL,5,
OL,6,FAurigny said rumours that all of its
OL,7,Fservices to and from Alderney were
OL,8,Fbeing cancelled in the next few days
OL,9,Fwere incorrect and said the "majority
OL,10,Fof the airline's planned schedule is
OL,11,Fexpected to operate".
